# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the prefill SDPA programme's oneq jobs (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a
# throwaway commit of tp4/fusion-1 (a branch that carries optimisation/ttnn-op/sdpa_prefill_oneq) and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. ONE TAG AT A TIME; wait for the run to
# finish; never cancel a running card job. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. A placeholder in @...@ is filled in by whoever drives the
# window (@SERVED_IMAGE@: the served image's reference; @K64J_OQ_GRAFT_DIR@ and @K64J_OQ_TTNNCPP_SHA256@: the K64j-OQ graft directory and its binary's digest, the K64J_OQ_TTNNCPP_SHA256 line of
# L1). C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the window's own image: the ONE fusion image, built by OQ-B0 (the fusion pack's B0 with C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ) from the pushed branch head
# (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the read rules and the minutes.
# OQ-B0 (STOP): the fusion window image on the K64j-OQ graft. EXACTLY the fusion pack's B0 (references/fusion-jobs/B0-build.env: the image built from the pushed branch head with the SHIP profile baked as the serving
# default and a session cap of 8) plus C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ: the Dockerfile's GRAFT_NAME/GRAFT_SHA build args take the K64j-OQ graft directory (opgraft-K64j-OQ in the builder's home, the build script's pin
# 2b81e28f...) instead of K64j, so the image's _ttnncpp.so is K64j plus the prefill factory's oneq edits (flag 0x8, inert unless QWEN_FAST_SDPA_PF_ONEQ=1) and QWEN_FAST_RUNTIME_BINARY_SHA256 is its digest.
# Use it IN PLACE OF B0 for a window that runs a oneq arm (this pack, and the generated ONEQ jobs of the fusion pack): every other arm of the window then runs the K64j-OQ binary with the lever off. TRAFFIC
# STAYS STRICT: packed_any_admission accepts the K64j-OQ binary in a gate boot (QWEN_C2_GATE=1) on the K64j evidence records, and in a traffic boot only on records made on K64j-OQ (WPP.json notes: the
# requalification list). READ: 'baking the serving default c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic with a session cap of 8', the provenance report '(a) ... K64j-OQ' lines with no problem line, the image id. A build, not a card job: it may run
# while the cards serve, never during a timing job. Duration (estimate): 40 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4
C2_BAKE_DEFAULT_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-traffic
C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ
